# Pencil saves .pen files as two-space-indented JSON. The penjson filter
# (tool/pen-json.mjs, configured by tool/setup.sh) stores them minified and
# checks them out indented, so a 107 MB working copy is a 26 MB blob.
# `binary` keeps git from attempting line-wise diffs and merges.
*.pen binary filter=penjson

*.png binary
*.ttf binary
